# Krateo Blueprint — AWS [[.ServiceTitle]] [[.AckKind]]

> Generated by `tools/ackgen` from the ACK `[[.AckKind]]` CRD (`[[.Group]]`).

Provisions an AWS [[.ServiceTitle]] **[[.AckKind]]** through the
[AWS Controllers for Kubernetes (ACK)](https://aws-controllers-k8s.github.io/community/)
[[.Service]] controller. The chart renders a native `[[.Group]]/[[.AckVersion]]` `[[.AckKind]]`
resource; the ACK controller reconciles it into the real AWS resource and reports status back.

Once the `CompositionDefinition` is applied, every `[[.CompKind]]` Composition you create
becomes an AWS [[.AckKind]].

## Prerequisites

- **ACK [[.Service]] controller installed** — see
  [`../../../docs/installing-controllers.md`](../../../docs/installing-controllers.md):
  ```sh
  helm install ack-[[.Service]]-controller \
    oci://public.ecr.aws/aws-controllers-k8s/[[.Service]]-chart \
    --namespace ack-system --create-namespace \
    --set aws.region=eu-west-1
  ```
- **AWS credentials configured** on that controller (IRSA/Pod Identity or static) — see
  [`../../../docs/authentication.md`](../../../docs/authentication.md).
- Krateo `core-provider` installed.

## Configuration

Composition `spec` fields **mirror the ACK [[.AckKind]] spec**. Full schema in
[`chart/values.schema.json`](chart/values.schema.json). The extra `region` field selects the
AWS region (empty = controller default).

## How to install

```sh
kubectl create namespace [[.Namespace]]
kubectl apply -f compositiondefinition.yaml   # publishes the [[.CompKind]] type
kubectl apply -f customform.yaml              # optional: portal card + form
```

This publishes a `[[.CompKind]]` Composition type (`composition.krateo.io/[[.CompVersion]]`,
plural `[[.CompPlural]]`), pulling the chart from
`oci://ghcr.io/krateo-blueprints/charts/[[.ChartName]]`.

### Create a Composition

```yaml
apiVersion: composition.krateo.io/[[.CompVersion]]
kind: [[.CompKind]]
metadata:
  name: my-[[.AckKindLower]]
  namespace: [[.Namespace]]
spec:
  region: eu-west-1
  # ... ACK [[.AckKind]] spec fields (see values.schema.json)
```

### Check status

```sh
kubectl get [[.CompPlural]].composition.krateo.io -n [[.Namespace]]
kubectl get [[.AckKindLower]]s.[[.Group]] -A
```
